node_modules
dist

# The runner's per-clone $GIT_DIR/info/exclude carries an unanchored `core.*`
# pattern for crash dumps (`core.<pid>`) that collides with
# src/authz/core.ts — a filename thunder-authentication's assets prescribe
# verbatim and that every other authz module imports by that path. A
# .gitignore negation outranks $GIT_DIR/info/exclude in git's precedence
# order, so this un-ignores it rather than renaming a prescribed file.
!src/authz/core.ts
